A/B autoboot (mt7986 / R3-mini): fast boot + space-to-stop instead of the 30s menu.

Ported from bpi-r3 z01 for R3-mini's two media defconfigs (emmc/snand; R3-mini
has no SD/NOR u-boot variant). BOOTDELAY 30 -> 1 and AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW ->
AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR (space). z02 (bootcount) builds on the AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR line
this adds. mt7986a_bpi-r3-mini-{emmc,snand} share R3's defconfig layout so the
hunks are identical to bpi-r3's, only the filenames differ.

--- a/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-mini-emmc_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-mini-emmc_defconfig
@@ -19,9 +19,9 @@
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART=y
 CONFIG_AHCI=y
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=30
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
 CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_OF_SYSTEM_SETUP=y
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE="mediatek/mt7986a-bpi-r3-mini.dtb"
 CONFIG_LOGLEVEL=7
--- a/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-mini-snand_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7986a_bpi-r3-mini-snand_defconfig
@@ -16,9 +16,9 @@
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART=y
 CONFIG_AHCI=y
 CONFIG_FIT=y
-CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=30
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
 CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_OF_SYSTEM_SETUP=y
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE="mediatek/mt7986a-bpi-r3-mini.dtb"
 CONFIG_LOGLEVEL=7
